window.GM={"cdn":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/","g":[["outer-wilds","Outer Wilds","753640",9.5,"Recommended","This seems weird to put in a detective category, but the amount of deduction you have to do to find all pieces of the puzzle is enough to place it in this category. The game is also top notch!","079ae4a7ff4b5875adc5c63c4c0b84e5a3e6966b/header.jpg?t=1785424341","Mobius Digital","18 Jun, 2020",["ss_ec95a283483f0438be40d033f08b9d956e748d54.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785424341","ss_09f0fa8d9b8d7da1408cf4e03303d896cbd9be18.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785424341","ss_c624a6b8edca0d451605592edd927dbcc14917a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785424341"],"22,99€"],["return-of-the-obra-dinn","Return of the Obra Dinn","653530",9,"Recommended","If you want a game where you have to do everything yourself, you get zero hints, no handholding and only a small tutorial at the start. Return of the Obra Dinn is definitely for you.","header.jpg?t=1686697594","Lucas Pope","18 Oct, 2018",["ss_7dd3476ace2170e134141e487f9491d4c9d094f3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1686697594","ss_380dc35237fde7d3863a44270abafc37924d1db4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1686697594","ss_69b3c98eda3c3476a4dee6a1a220169ac70dcb6d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1686697594"],"19,50€"],["the-incident-at-galley-house","The Incident at Galley House","3641000",8.5,"Recommended","A nice investigation game, with a lot of mystery surrounding it. Voice acting, story, the feeling, the deduction part. They were all on point in my opinion.","c36fe32e992c59c8eb560fd5d97bed0f96c08ff5/header.jpg?t=1789391393","William Rous, Evil Trout Inc.","14 Jul, 2026",["3fff449397908b076576510e37b1fbff5f4c1c59/ss_3fff449397908b076576510e37b1fbff5f4c1c59.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789391393","38b8de5af491e86ec5835f86f75ab8ef999d3db3/ss_38b8de5af491e86ec5835f86f75ab8ef999d3db3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789391393","d75354abd1f747e86dcc7dece06a7e93ada1ddcc/ss_d75354abd1f747e86dcc7dece06a7e93ada1ddcc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789391393"],"20,49€"],["duck-detective-the-secret-salami","Duck Detective: The Secret Salami","2637990",8,"Recommended","A cozy detective game with nice voice overs, it's a mix of comedy and drama. Fun game, maybe not as hard as other games on this list, but it gets my approval because of the overall style.","1170941bed8a49632e5e35ad052811f36cd33078/header.jpg?t=1793887353","Happy Broccoli Games","23 May, 2024",["ss_27259680f19e3c978691ff12408b1254ce39821c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793887353","ss_7eb2efa54d025e7586692a8b758d9e7892e18087.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793887353","ss_4d5017081a4d56751283637224d257de608ba3a7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793887353"],"9,75€"],["the-rise-of-the-golden-idol","The Rise of the Golden Idol","2716400",8,"Recommended","Sequel to The Case of the Golden Idol, so the gameplay is the same, but I like the modern vibe of the game. It also has some new types of puzzles that are enjoyable.","header.jpg?t=1782893698","Color Gray Games","12 Nov, 2024",["ss_e3c94629916bc649ac1cb635179562d762b56efa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782893698","ss_0cd3157d807147f83a493b28602545e4e849934b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782893698","ss_7cf4014beff826c1588d1f858a0e49c79abb87cb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782893698"],"19,50€"],["the-case-of-the-golden-idol","The Case of the Golden Idol","1677770",7.5,"Recommended","A 'frozen painting' investigation game where you have to complete sentences to find out what happened. It has a compelling story, even if there isn't voice acting.","71f6989b1a20b121d7ad64e1191fb65a9520c498/header.jpg?t=1793622874","Color Gray Games","13 Oct, 2022",["ss_d817a8158f79e7881241f0d4470cd010f2fbe44f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793622874","ss_e9593cf60f8e7fd96d205f5be6b45a487365fa29.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793622874","ss_ca307de7f24032327368d7d1718833331e481cc8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793622874"],"17,99€"],["duck-detective-the-ghost-of-glamping","Duck Detective: The Ghost of Glamping","2714620",7.5,"Recommended","The sequel in the Duck Detective series. Honestly I found the story of the first game more compelling. This one has a more creepy and supernatural undertone to it, but still good enough.","header.jpg?t=1793961054","Happy Broccoli Games","22 May, 2025",["ss_829f828be601b21f1e06cbd837e7f75f759daa44.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793961054","ss_e93ba93151465dc03d68a7cdbedb502dc865c541.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793961054","ss_9cce1ff91aab215a9261609d0ad80dbc078df67b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793961054"],"9,75€"],["unheard","Unheard","942970",7.5,"Recommended","Where a lot of games focus on the visuals, UNHEARD is all about the sounds. You're playing on a top down map, so you can't follow all conversations together.","header.jpg?t=1728551840","NEXT Studios","28 Mar, 2019",["ss_9c4721d6775f0d3fb4cbe12e3c634cbaa2b27ba8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728551840","ss_90ec627a453e47c3350efe6ef82a33e3e1ce6def.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728551840","ss_d5101b9b336ba94633b134504012b9e1a94fd39e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728551840"],"5,69€"],["shadows-of-doubt","Shadows of Doubt","986130",6.5,"Not for me","Is it me or is it so difficult to catch one perpetrator in this game? I like the amount of freedom you get and the endless possibilities, but it only got me hooked for a while.","header.jpg?t=1793875831","ColePowered Games","26 Sep, 2024",["ss_ca595338d1dcb9ae46601ef917bbe38ade9119c4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793875831","ss_6e8b247fbef7b2be4d87b4a7ef9d6bae191e39f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793875831","ss_36346e86ecfb3d72d2280f83bdbd5b9cfdb07385.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793875831"],"24,99€"],["the-painscreek-killings","The Painscreek Killings","624270",6,"Recommended","More of an 'investigation mystery' game. The deduction part was on the low side in my opinion, it was a lot of searching and walking. I liked the story though.","bd2ea02b77283f36d9a618cff8ec3f2d242c4c39/header.jpg?t=1791490267","EQ Studios","27 Sep, 2017",["ss_c28034b64c0d76f3d808d4542d50c85281eafe5f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791490267","ss_1570195922d602ed5d147192a1e259ede111092d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791490267","ss_e0e3c32c8e39623c23efe9b85a81ba07c657bff0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791490267"],"19,99€"],["overboard","Overboard!","1546920",6,"Not for me","A game where you are the murderer and have to get away with it. It wasn't really my forte. Replaying the game to find other options didn't suit me, I wanted to see a 'reverse time' mechanic.","header.jpg?t=1741784169","inkle Ltd","2 Jun, 2021",["ss_cd060d7a463f78e707173e18370f54adb55ef181.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741784169","ss_6624a85fa17a278fe06f1dd888e04cf5e4e4dcfd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741784169","ss_c9a97a87c917fa41097531fffd191f3c85d5866d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741784169"],"12,49€"],["the-diary","The Diary","2343880",5,"Not for me","You don't need a lot of deductive reasoning in this game. The diary is the main piece of content you interact with. It has this cozy cutout feeling to it, but it's not really detective material.","header.jpg?t=1750415132","HuCang Studio, Pone Games","20 Jun, 2025",["ss_5db38d57123e7e88142273eb9cb2094484116b6b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750415132","ss_9ad73d8ae76cdf67839f80ca933bdeeffaf18366.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750415132","a41741ec39c48aaa50662a6eb7f1f11a0464018b/ss_a41741ec39c48aaa50662a6eb7f1f11a0464018b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750415132"],"15,79€"],["the-roottrees-are-dead","The Roottrees are Dead","2754380",8.5,"Recommended","You search for information on an in-game web browser to fill in a giant family tree. This game is no walk in the park, I couldn't complete it without looking at hints online. Still a very good game with a lot of secrets, and big enough for a real detective mind. Completing the whole game can be hard, but it's worth playing.","6c1be65b8ae88dead50e0fa854790245a2ac072a/header.jpg?t=1789391159","Evil Trout Inc.","15 Jan, 2025",["ss_fbdc2236369583a9123f2bcfc1bba1e915c62d02.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789391159","ss_f7df5d0b71a2a7f8a84af945a6324c2e51c4965e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789391159","ss_6caf606c6def8bbb20d980a01523e454ff21f37b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789391159"],"19,50€"]],"checked":"9 Nov 2026","b":[["deception-murder-in-hong-kong","Deception: Murder in Hong Kong","Party","4 to 12","20 min","The ideal detective game if you don't have a lot of players, but still want a good cat-and-mouse feel. In my opinion it's best with a lower amount of players, like 5 or 6, so everyone is more involved.","https://cf.geekdo-images.com/1COY3oeK9aN2_XNimKaNww__itemrep/img/cAOvicFEw8eQs6D9b2G4E7MTp00=/fit-in/246x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic3033330.jpg","Case 03"],["hidden-games-de-case-klein-apelroos","Hidden Games: De Case Klein-Apelroos","Box case","1 to 6","90 to 180 min","My first physical case file: an envelope full of evidence and a few questions to solve. It's really fun to play with a small group and puzzle all clues together, but getting all evidence right at the beginning feels overwhelming. Overall it's worth it.","https://cf.geekdo-images.com/NFN-oNosuQqhPc-FYv4PAw__itemrep/img/Wqnu7w0r0Kqh0S-PBmtnCvp_lfQ=/fit-in/246x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic6163740.jpg","Reel"],["dead-of-winter","Dead of Winter","Board game","2 to 5","60 to 120 min","The game has strong RPG elements, which makes it very immersive. 3 to 4 players is perfect. You can also play with a traitor, which makes it much harder. I recommend playing with allies only.","https://cf.geekdo-images.com/g4mV4BH-ZrhMUVgil-yV1A__itemrep/img/Tc76KEZmrLgCrsvhQAW36iv7x9E=/fit-in/246x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic3016500.jpg","Case 05"],["spyfall-2","Spyfall 2","Party","3 to 12","15 min","Perfect as an icebreaker for game nights, or for larger groups that don't want a lot of rules. Easy, everyone can play.","https://cf.geekdo-images.com/4nE3EGcIVJnItZOdZ2NrxA__itemrep/img/QYIEqFna0OPNhS6xUxM9o_jIiGc=/fit-in/246x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic4141398.jpg","Case 001"],["the-werewolves-of-millers-hollow","The Werewolves of Miller's Hollow","Party","8 to 18","30 min","Easy, but you need to know the roles beforehand because they're not written on the cards. With enough cards, the only limit is your room capacity.","https://cf.geekdo-images.com/rZ0tOafAt1oue_7NKqELsg__itemrep/img/8Ku8ENBwf0oH1uWnMMoXKkRIRe0=/fit-in/246x300/filters:strip_icc()/pic7203269.jpg","Case 002"]],"now":["legion-was-here","Legion Was Here","3492120","2d1de35b4953a8fe26bbbe6d6f22b83f2e271549/header.jpg?t=1788930612"]};